    'In specific locations within the HTML, such as the text content of an element or the value of an attribute, browsers will automatically decode these references when they parse the document. When injecting inside such a location, you can occasionally take advantage of this to obfuscate payloads for client-side attacks, hiding them from any server-side defences that are in place.' => 'Saat merender isi elemen maupun nilai atribut HTML, peramban otomatis mendekode referensi entitas tersebut. Perilaku ini berguna untuk menyembunyikan payload XSS dari filter sisi server.',
