    'If your payload still gets blocked after HTML encoding it, you may find that you can evade the filter just by prefixing the code points with a few zeros:' => 'Menambahkan sejumlah angka nol di depan kode karakter terkadang cukup untuk mengelabui filter:',
    'Obfuscation via XML encoding' => 'Penyamaran melalui XML encoding',
