    'If you right-click on a request and select <strong>Do active scan</strong>, Burp Scanner will use its default configuration to audit only this request.' => 'Klik kanan permintaan yang diinginkan lalu pilih <strong>Do active scan</strong> agar pemindai hanya mengaudit permintaan tersebut.',
