    "Although you can just define a single insertion point using Intruder, it's often quicker to use the [[A0]]Scan manual insertion point[[/A0]] extension. You can highlight any sequence of characters within the request, typically a parameter value, and select <strong>Extensions > Scan manual insertion point</strong> from the context menu." => 'Ekstensi [[A0]]Scan manual insertion point[[/A0]] mempercepat langkah ini melalui menu konteks <strong>Extensions > Scan manual insertion point</strong>.',
